Created hello. Run it: cd hello && cesia do run
[project]
name = "hello"

[tasks.run]
file = "src/main.ce"
Print("Hello from hello")
> cesia run src/main.ce
Hello from hello
hello already exists.
exit 1
A project name holds letters, digits, - and _, not a/b.
exit 2
usage: cesia run [--allow LIST] [--limit LIST] [--watch] [--debugger FILE] [--no-spec] file.ce [args...]
       cesia test [path] [--no-spec]
       cesia do [task]
       cesia new name
       cesia doc [name]
       cesia version
exit 2
